Check unavailable disk devices in container telemetry and setup tests.

Guix build sandboxes can expose no disk devices.  The telemetry regression
checks the unknown-measurement representation when psutil returns no counters.
The rotational-disk check returns None when sysfs is unavailable; allow
that result in its integration test without requiring /sys/block.

